# ============================================================================
# THE LAST DATASET — Vercel deployment manifest (static frontend only).
#
# Vercel publishes this repository as a static site (the game in index.html).
# The Express backend (server/) and the five challenge services run on their
# own Node hosts, so none of them belong in the static mirror.
#
# Publishing them is an active information leak rather than just dead weight:
#   Bonus CTF/server/engine.js      contains the CTF 4 flag
#   Red Zone CTF 2 & 3 /tools/*     print the CTF 2 / CTF 3 flags
#   data.js                         legacy flag/hint table (20 answers)
#   _smoke.js                       development service token + admin password
#   server/**                       verifier logic, seed, tests
#
# Files the live game actually needs stay published: index.html, config/,
# src/, admin/, style.css, app.js, audio.js, ml.js, package.json.
#
# After deploying, confirm the leak is closed (expect 404):
#   curl -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\n' https://<site>/Bonus%20CTF/server/engine.js
#   curl -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\n' https://<site>/server/server.js
# ============================================================================

/server/
/red-zone-ctf1/
/Red Zone CTF 2/
/Red Zone CTF 3/
/Bonus CTF/
/CTF 5 - THE LAST GATEKEEPER/
/docs/
/_smoke.js
/_urlcheck.js
/data.js
/.data/
/logs/
/node_modules/
.env
.env.*
